
# machine translated (Spanish), not yet reviewed by a person.

# What a device runs, shown in a device's small line, when it is an iPhone or iPad.
settings-tailscale-system-ios = iPhone o iPad

# In a device's small line: the device is on the network now.
settings-tailscale-online = conectado ahora

# In a device's small line: the device has never been seen.
settings-tailscale-not-seen = aún no visto

# In a device's small line: when the device was last online; the date is already written.
settings-tailscale-last-online = última conexión { $day }

# Shown beside the Use Tailscale switch while the password is asked for, when Tailscale is already installed.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-tailscale-waiting = Esperando la contraseña...

# Shown beside the Use Tailscale switch while the password is asked for, before Tailscale is installed.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-tailscale-waiting-install = Esperando la contraseña y luego instalando Tailscale...

# Shown beside the switch after Tailscale is turned on.
settings-tailscale-done-on = Tailscale activado

# Shown beside the switch after Tailscale is turned off.
settings-tailscale-done-off = Tailscale desactivado

# Shown under the Sign in line once the browser is being opened.
settings-tailscale-opening = Abriendo la página de inicio de sesión en tu navegador...

# Red words under the Sign in line when Tailscale could not be started.
settings-tailscale-not-started = No se pudo iniciar Tailscale.

# Red words under the Sign out line when signing out did not work.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-tailscale-sign-out-failed = Tailscale no quiso cerrar la sesión.

# Headline of the page while Tailscale is being asked how it is.
settings-tailscale-top-asking = Preguntando a Tailscale…

# Headline of the page when Tailscale is off and not installed.
settings-tailscale-top-not-installed = Tailscale no está instalado. Actívalo abajo para instalarlo.

# Headline of the page when Tailscale is installed but off.
settings-tailscale-top-off = Tailscale está desactivado, así que no usa memoria.

# Headline of the page when Tailscale is on but does not answer.
settings-tailscale-top-silent = Tailscale no responde. Puede que aún se esté iniciando.

# Headline of the page when connected: the name of the private network and of this computer.
settings-tailscale-top-connected = Conectado a { $network } como { $name }.

# Name used in the headline for the private network when it has no name of its own.
settings-tailscale-network-fallback = Tailscale

# Headline of the page when Tailscale is on and has to be signed in to.
settings-tailscale-top-sign-in = Tailscale está activado. Inicia sesión abajo para unirte a tu red privada.

# Headline of the page for any other state; the state is already written in lower case.
settings-tailscale-top-state = Tailscale está { $state }.

# Name of the page in the list of settings pages.
settings-tailscale-title = Tailscale

# Words the settings search looks for on this page (not shown).
settings-tailscale-keywords = tailscale vpn red privada dispositivos remoto tailnet

# Help text at the top of the page.
settings-tailscale-help = Tailscale une tus propios equipos y teléfonos en una sola red privada, estén donde estén. No se instala nada hasta que lo actives, y mientras esté desactivado no usa memoria.

# Small line under the Use Tailscale switch before Tailscale is installed.
settings-tailscale-switch-sub-first = Lo instala desde la fuente propia de Tailscale.

# Small line under the Use Tailscale switch once Tailscale is installed.
settings-tailscale-switch-sub = Desactivado: detenido, no arranca con el equipo.

# Text of the switch that turns Tailscale on or off, and heading of its line.
settings-tailscale-switch = Usar Tailscale

# Help text (i button) of the Tailscale card when Tailscale is off or has not answered.
settings-tailscale-about-plain = La primera vez que se activa, Tailscale se instala desde la fuente de software propia de Tailscale y luego se inicia. Su servicio en segundo plano usa memoria mientras está activo, así que solo funciona cuando esto está activado. Mientras esté desactivado, Tailscale está detenido y no arranca con el equipo. El cortafuegos deja entrar a tus propios dispositivos Tailscale y mantiene fuera todo lo demás como antes.

# Help text (i button) of the Tailscale card when Tailscale is on but not yet connected.
settings-tailscale-about-sign-in = { settings-tailscale-about-plain } Al iniciar sesión se abre la página de inicio de sesión de Tailscale en tu navegador. Usa la misma cuenta en cada uno de tus dispositivos.

# Help text (i button) of the Tailscale card when connected.
settings-tailscale-about-connected = { settings-tailscale-about-plain } Al cerrar la sesión, este equipo sale de tu red privada hasta que vuelvas a iniciarla.

# Line in the devices card when there are no other devices.
settings-tailscale-no-devices = Aún no hay otros dispositivos

# Small line under "No other devices yet".
settings-tailscale-no-devices-sub = Inicia sesión en otro con la misma cuenta.

# Shown on the devices card while Tailscale is off.
settings-tailscale-waits-off = Activa Tailscale para ver tus dispositivos.

# Shown on the devices card while Tailscale has not answered.
settings-tailscale-waits-looking = Buscando tus dispositivos…

# Shown on the devices card when Tailscale needs signing in to.
settings-tailscale-waits-sign-in = Inicia sesión para ver tus dispositivos.

# Shown on the devices card when Tailscale is on but not connected.
settings-tailscale-waits-connect = Conéctate para ver tus dispositivos.

# Small line under this computer when it has no address yet.
settings-tailscale-no-address = Aún no tiene dirección.

# Small line under this computer: its address on the private network.
settings-tailscale-address = { $address } en tu red privada.

# Name of this computer's line when Tailscale gives it no name.
settings-tailscale-this-computer = Este equipo

# Heading of the line that signs in to Tailscale, and tip of its round button.
settings-tailscale-sign-in = Iniciar sesión

# Small line under the Sign in line.
settings-tailscale-sign-in-sub = Abre la página de inicio de sesión en tu navegador.

# Heading of the line that joins the private network again, and tip of its round button.
settings-tailscale-connect = Conectar

# Small line under the Connect line.
settings-tailscale-connect-sub = Te une de nuevo a tu red privada.

# Heading of the line that says the firewall lets the person's own devices in.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-tailscale-firewall = Tus propios dispositivos pueden entrar

# Small line under that heading.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-tailscale-firewall-sub = Todo lo demás se mantiene fuera, como antes.

# Heading of the line that signs out, and tip of its button.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-tailscale-sign-out = Cerrar sesión

# Small line under the Sign out line.
settings-tailscale-sign-out-sub = Sale de tu red privada.

# Heading of the card with the Tailscale switch.
settings-tailscale-card = Tailscale

# Heading of the card that lists the person's devices.
settings-tailscale-devices = Tus dispositivos

# Help text (i button) of the Your devices card.
settings-tailscale-devices-about = Todos los dispositivos que han iniciado sesión en tu red privada, con su dirección en ella, lo que ejecutan y cuándo se conectaron por última vez. Para añadir uno, instala Tailscale en tu teléfono o en otro equipo e inicia sesión con la misma cuenta.

